<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es" class="dark" data-apk="false">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{{ title }} · T.N.S.V.T</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('styles/tokens.css') }}" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('styles/elev.css') }}" />
    <style>
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #050308 0%, #100b1c 50%, #16121f 100%);
            color: #e9def6;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        }
        .redirect-container {
            max-width: 700px;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            backdrop-filter: blur(25px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 1rem;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .icon-big {
            font-size: 5rem;
            color: #f2ca50;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        h1 {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f2ca50 0%, #ffe088 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .description {
            color: #d0c5af;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }
        .feature-item {
            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #e9def6;
        }
        .status {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
            background: rgba(255, 211, 0, 0.15);
            color: #ffd300;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 211, 0, 0.3);
            border-radius: 1rem;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .status.legacy {
            background: rgba(100, 116, 139, 0.15);
            color: #94a3b8;
            border-color: rgba(100, 116, 139, 0.3);
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f2ca50 0%, #ffe088 100%);
            color: #241a00;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            margin: 0.5rem;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);
        }
        .btn-secondary {
            background: transparent;
            color: #e9def6;
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border-elev);
        }
        .info {
            color: #99907c;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="redirect-container">
        <div class="icon-big material-symbols-elev">{{ icon }}</div>
        <span class="status legacy">Módulo legacy</span>
        <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
        <p class="description">{{ description }}</p>

        <div class="features">
            {% for feature in features %}
            <div class="feature-item">• {{ feature }}</div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>

        <a href="https://tnsvt.com{{ legacy_path }}" class="btn">Ir a {{ title }} en tnsvt.com →</a>
        <a href="/sanctum" class="btn btn-secondary">← Volver al Sanctum</a>

        <p class="info">
            Este módulo se ejecuta en el código legacy. Próximamente será migrado a v2.
        </p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>